      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Write suitable words to complete the conversation.</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"/images/exams/SET_2_-_NATURAL_DISASTERS_4_f0ddb171.png\" alt width=\"500\"></strong></p>\n<p>Anna: Did you see the news about the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.1</label><input id='fbo-901627-0' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='0' name='fbo-901627-0' type='text' size='8' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901627-0' /></span></strong> yesterday?</p>\n<p>Tom: Yes, it was terrible. The big waves destroyed many homes near the beach.</p>\n<p>Anna: I heard the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.2</label><input id='fbo-901627-1' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='1' name='fbo-901627-1' type='text' size='8' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901627-1' /></span></strong> made it even worse. It brought heavy rain and strong winds.</p>\n<p>Tom: That&#8217;s true. And the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.3</label><input id='fbo-901627-2' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='2' name='fbo-901627-2' type='text' size='17' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901627-2' /></span></strong> are doing an amazing job to help people find safe places to stay.</p>\n<p>Anna: They are so brave. I saw them moving <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.4</label><input id='fbo-901627-3' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='3' name='fbo-901627-3' type='text' size='9' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901627-3' /></span></strong> to clear the blocked roads.</p>\n<p>Tom: I hope everyone stays safe and recovers soon.</p>\n<p>Anna: Me too, Tom. Natural disasters are so scary.</p>",
